( tpef_force10: post_element_force (manual Professional 6.927) on the
  force10 cantilever - the exact same model as the arness gforce10:
  2 hex8 10x10x50, fixed at z=0, total load (0,1000,-123.4) at the
  top face, section at z=0 (the fixed face) with normal=(0,0,1),
  shear0=(1,0,0), shear1=(0,1,0), middle=(5,5,0). The geometry
  restricts to the z=0 nodes (the quadrilateral at z=0). Expected
  (the Professional's own result): normal=-123.4, shear0~0,
  shear1=1000, moment0~0, moment1=-100000. )

echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
derivatives
materi_velocity
materi_velocity_integrated
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
number_of_integration_points 8
end_initia

options_mesh -fixed_in_space -fixed_in_space -fixed_in_space
options_convection -no
options_inertia -no

node 1  0. 0. 0.
node 2  10. 0. 0.
node 3  0. 10. 0.
node 4  10. 10. 0.
node 5  0. 0. 50.
node 6  10. 0. 50.
node 7  0. 10. 50.
node 8  10. 10. 50.
node 9  0. 0. 100.
node 10 10. 0. 100.
node 11 0. 10. 100.
node 12 10. 10. 100.

element 1  -hex8 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8
element_group 1 0
element 2  -hex8 5 6 7 8 9 10 11 12
element_group 2 0

group_type 0  -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0  1.e7
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0  0.0
group_materi_memory 0  -total_linear

( the z=0 face quadrilateral for the section geometry )
geometry_quadrilateral 1  0. 0. 0.  10. 0. 0.  0. 10. 0.  10. 10. 0.  1.e-5

( the cross-section definition )
post_element_force 10  0. 0. 1.  1. 0. 0.  0. 1. 0.  5. 5. 0.
post_element_force_geometry 10  -geometry_quadrilateral 1

bounda_unknown 0  -ra 1 2 3 4 -ra -velx -vely -velz
bounda_time    0  0. 0. 100. 0.

( the top face load: consistent nodal loads of the uniform face
  traction (0,10,-1.234)/unit area on the 10x10 face: total
  (0,1000,-123.4), 4 corner nodes -> (0,250,-30.85) each )
bounda_force 2  9 -vely
bounda_time  2  0. 250. 100. 250.
bounda_force 3  9 -velz
bounda_time  3  0. -30.85 100. -30.85
bounda_force 4  10 -vely
bounda_time  4  0. 250. 100. 250.
bounda_force 5  10 -velz
bounda_time  5  0. -30.85 100. -30.85
bounda_force 6  11 -vely
bounda_time  6  0. 250. 100. 250.
bounda_force 7  11 -velz
bounda_time  7  0. -30.85 100. -30.85
bounda_force 8  12 -vely
bounda_time  8  0. 250. 100. 250.
bounda_force 9  12 -velz
bounda_time  9  0. -30.85 100. -30.85

control_timestep 30  1.  1.0

( targets: the Professional's own values (positional: 0=normal,
  1=shear0, 2=shear1, 3=moment0, 4=moment1) )
target_item 40  -post_element_force_result 10 0
target_value 40  -123.4 1.5
target_item 60  -post_element_force_result 10 2
target_value 60  1000. 15.
target_item 80  -post_element_force_result 10 4
target_value 80  -100000. 1500.
end_data
